 * identity provider (e.g. Google Workspace, Microsoft Entra ID, Auth0). The
 * session layer (session.js) and the MFA layer (totp.js) remain.
 *
 * Environment variables:
 *   GEV_AUTH_DISABLED   – set to '1' to bypass auth entirely (local dev only;
 *                          not honoured when NODE_ENV=production).
 *   GEV_ADMIN_USER      – username for the built-in admin account (default: admin).
 *   GEV_ADMIN_PASS_HASH – sha256 hex of the admin password (required in prod).
 *   GEV_ADMIN_TOTP      – Base32 TOTP secret for the admin account (required in prod).
 *
